---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What personal data the Osvanta website and Osvanta Bus Log Analyzer handle.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 18 November 2026</p>
    <p class="lead">
      This website sets no cookies and runs no analytics or tracking scripts. The application sends
      nothing about you or your measurements anywhere.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is served by GitHub Pages. Like any web server, GitHub
        receives your IP address and the pages you request, and keeps them in its own logs for
        security purposes. Osvanta has no access to those logs.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Cookies and tracking.</strong> None. There is no cookie banner because there is nothing to consent to.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Links to other sites.</strong> Links to GitHub, YouTube and Microsoft Forms open
        those services, which handle your data under their own privacy notices.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      When you write to <a href="mailto:support@osvanta.com">support@osvanta.com</a>, we receive
      your email address and whatever you put in the message. We use it only to answer you and to
      fix the problem you describe. Our mailbox is hosted by Zoho Mail. Ask at the same address if
      you want your correspondence deleted.
    </p>

    <h2>The application</h2>
    <p>
      Osvanta Bus Log Analyzer opens no network connection of its own. It has no telemetry, no
      usage statistics and no update checks. Its logs, settings and last session stay in a folder
      of your own on your computer.
    </p>
    <p>
      The details, including every file the application writes, are in
      <a href="/bus-log-analyzer/security-and-data/">Security and data handling</a> in the user
      guide.
    </p>

    <h2>The user survey</h2>
    <p>
      The survey linked from the application is a Microsoft Forms page and is optional. Nothing
      about your measurements, databases or computer is passed to it.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
      If this notice changes, the date at the top changes with it. Questions about it go to
      <a href="mailto:support@osvanta.com">support@osvanta.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
